('a2N20000000PdEAEA0', 'Kate Trahan Shirley', '0052X000007osqKQAQ', 'Briefings & Alerts', 'Destination Intelligence - GoBase', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Traveler Security', 'GoBase is the foundation of the Intelliguide suite and offers continually updated destination and security intelligence. GoBase information is available via a website that can be set up to be accessible companywide or to only a select few employees. GoBase includes: destination reports, news briefs, consular information, and risk assessments. Optional GoBase resources are: airport guides, travel health, cultural etiquette, and event anniversaries and significant dates.'),
