('a2N20000000PdEWEA0', 'Guillaume Leclerc', '005w0000003DenvAAC', 'Account Management', 'Total Trip Planning - routeRANK', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', '** We no longer have a referral agreement with routeRANK. Before having discussions on door to door trip planning, reach out to Klaus Goddard or Solutions Consulting to further qualify your client. **

