('a2N20000000PdEhEAK', 'Sandra Ling', '005w0000003Dm0hAAC', 'Advisory Services', 'Consulting - Advisory Services', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'We will be replacing this tools & services record by breaking the Advito consulting services into multiple tools & services to align with Advito practice areas.  Please use one of the specific Advito practice area tools and services in place of this one.'),
('a2N20000000PdEjEAK', 'Jess Tindall', '005bG00000Gs5eDQAR', 'BCD Pay', 'Virtual Payment Automation (VPA) & Virtual Payment Automation Plus (VPA+)', 'Active', 'Booking', 'T&E Spend Management', 'Virtual Payment Automation (VPA) is recommended for customers who pay their hotel bills centrally. It deploys a single-use, unique virtual credit card number for each hotel booking and matches all charges to a specific traveler and trip. Virtual cards have significant security benefits over traditional credit card types, and detailed reporting makes reconciliation much easier. 

