('a2N20000000PdEkEAK', 'Kate Trahan Shirley', '0052X000007osqKQAQ', 'Tracking', 'DecisionSource Security', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Traveler Security', 'DecisionSource Security helps provide duty of care and reduce a company''s risk. With DecisionSource Security, you have access to an interactive security map to see where travelers are and what events might impact them allowing you to respond accordingly and communicate directly with affected travelers (SMS or email) if necessary. In addition to flexible reporting, DecisionSource Security also provides access to GoAlerts, GoPNR, and GoBase (i.e. travel alerts, destination reports, and a security/risk intelligence database).'),
('a2N20000000PdEpEAK', 'Simone Gray', '0057T000000XAXDQA4', 'VAT Reclaim', 'Taxeo', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Taxeo takes the pain out of reclaiming value-added tax from international travel. Clients with a local presence in Europe and in the US can reclaim the VAT they pay when their travelers travel to European VAT countries.

