('a2N2X0000002lsjUAA', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Performance Management', 'Advito - Intelligence & Analytics', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Reporting & Analytics', 'We help clients expand their data strategy to enhance the strategic value of their corporate travel program. Advito''s methodologies push beyond the traditional to transform data into stories. With clear, cross-industry insights and useful analytics, we help clients satisfy executive leadership, align travel with overall corporate initiatives, achieve sustainability goals, and drive new value in their travel program.

