('a2N2X000000ehZXUAY', 'Hannah Kahn', '005w00000060YA0AAM', 'Booking', 'AgentSource Desktop', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'AgentSource Desktop is BCD Travel''s comprehensive point of service platform. it consolidates all the tools, manages processes and streamlines information, which in turn helps agents focus on the personalized services that matter most. It comprised of 4 distinct capabilities. Each one focused on ways to enhance the experience of both the agent and the traveler. By creating an agent-centric platform that delivers everything in one place we can provide efficient and expert service to our customers.'),
('a2N2X000000fE4UUAU', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Advisory Services', 'Advito - Sustainable Collaboration', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'BCD Connect', 'Advito''s Sustainable Collaboration team helps clients reduce the environmental footprint of their travel program, drive savings, and increase traveler satisfaction. With an optimal mix of advanced business intelligence, our proprietary carbon emissions calculation methodology, and our supplier management and Traveler Engagement strategies, clients can ensure reduced carbon emissions, increased productivity, and satisfaction - no matter how their employees work together.

