('a2N2X000003pecWUAQ', 'Amy Thorson Stokes', '005w0000004khFcAAI', 'Booking', 'AgentSource - Affiliates', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'TripSource Shopping & Booking', 'Affiliate Program information for AgentSource, our proprietary booking solution built especially with your clients in mind. The AgentSource value proposition is simple: Broader content, simplify agent decision-making and everything on one place.'),
