('a2N7T000000lxvrUAA', 'Sarina Sra-Sanchez', '00520000001kpJJAAY', 'Booking', 'Hotel Viewership', 'Active', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'BCD Travelâ€™s Hotel Viewership team is responsible for managing the hotel viewership process globally.  This viewership process is also the first step in implementing hotel rates into the GDSs, OBTs, AgentSource Booking (ASB) and TripSource Booking.  
