('a2N7T000001vVgNUAU', 'Kelly Ford', '005w0000005xi46AAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'Healthcare Providers and Patients (HCPP) Service', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'BCD Travel''s HCPP Services provide clients with 24x7 or after-hours support for their Healthcare Providers and Patients via a centralized team of specially trained consultants. We support a wide range of services specific to these unique travelers. This fee-based service is currently available in NORAM and Europe with APAC to follow in the future.'),
('a2N7T000001vWWyUAM', 'Cherise George', '00520000001l124AAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'Debit Memo Audit & Reconciliation (DMAR)', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Centralized Operations', 'Debit Memo Audit and Reconciliation (DMAR) is a support service that analyzes and processes Agency Debit Memos (ADMs), Agency Commission Recalls, and Agency Credit Memos (ACMs). The team advocates on behalf of Operations to: 
â€¢	achieve timely payment of valid ADMs and vendor acceptance and closure of invalid ADMs.
â€¢	determine the root cause of consistent valid errors. 
â€¢	decrease incidents of unfair debit memo practices by vendors.
â€¢	protect earned override incentives.
â€¢	provide reporting.'),
('a2N7T000001vWodUAE', 'Cherise George', '00520000001l124AAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'NORAM Quality Interaction (QI)', 'Active', 'Booking', 'Centralized Operations', 'The Quality Interaction (QI) Team recognizes the complexity of the consultant role and just how impactful those interactions can be. In addition to process compliance and reservation accuracy, first impressions matter. Weâ€™re here to help monitor and increase the level of customer service consultants provide to your customers.'),
('a2N7T000001vWvIUAU', 'Morten Bundgaard', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Mobility Services', 'Deloitte Workforce Solution', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Deloitte has been added to the growing number of Mobility specialists who now have access to our Travel API. This means that they will be able to access real-time travel data to help power their suite of mobility tools that support organization with Business Travelers. This will allow them to support our mutual clients by providing compliance services across a variety of areas including Immigration, Posted Workers Directive, Social Security and Tax. These are areas where many of our clients struggle with compliance.

Please use the microsite link under Materials to access further information.  This will support you in conversations with your clients and answering any questions that may come up. 

If you have additional questions, please contact Morten Bundgaard: morten.bundgaard@bcdtravel.dk'),
('a2N7T000002BMqcUAG', 'Morten Bundgaard', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Mobility Services', 'ECA Comply (TST International)', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Comply is the original business travel tracking platform, continually evolving to meet the needs of global organizations.'),
('a2N7T000002BNWYUA4', 'Hannah Kahn', '005w00000060YA0AAM', 'Booking', 'BCD Invite', 'Active', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'BCD Invite delivers a secure, global and progressive solution to streamline the management of unprofiled travelers'),
('a2N7T000002BNrGUAW', 'Morten Bundgaard', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Mobility Services', 'KPMG', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'KPMG LLP develops and implements comprehensive talent mobility solutions for multi-national corporations. By combining deep industry experience and highly distinguished insights in tax, payroll, compensation, and benefits, they enable their clients to strategically manage their mobility programs.'),
('a2N7T000002BOsFUAW', 'Morten Bundgaard', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Risk Management', 'Maiden Voyage', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Maiden Voyage is your trusted partner for all things inclusive business travel safety. 
Maiden Voyage is available globally.
Maiden Voyage is a BCD Marketplace authorized partner. For more information, visit the BCD Marketplace https://marketplace.bcdtravel.com/'),
('a2N7T000002BRoCUAW', 'Cherise George', '00520000001l124AAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'NORAM Customer Care', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'The NORAM Customer Care team understands that mistakes happen. Even if a mistake is made or there is a misunderstanding, most customers will be understanding and patient â€“ as long as we are able to address the problem and provide a solution quickly. We know that when exceptional service recovery is provided, we increase customer loyalty. We do this by acknowledging all customer concerns within one business day through a personal introduction email from a Customer Care Champion. The customer will receive a case update every 72 hours on all open cases, however we strive to resolve all cases within five business days.  

As a service provider, we know that BCD Travel has an opportunity to learn from our mistakes. After researching and resolving customer concerns, our Customer Care Champions will document and code each case to ensure our trend reporting is actionable by other internal teams so we can prevent issues from reoccurring when possible.'),
('a2N7T000002BRvUUAW', 'Marcel de Wit', '005w0000005zrp5AAA', 'Payment', 'AirPlus', 'Active', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Payment & Expense', 'AirPlus International is a leading international provider of corporate payment solutions. 53,000 corporate customers rely on AirPlus for the payment and evaluation of their business trips and other purchasing services.
AirPlus is available to our clients as an authorized BCD marketplace provider.
AirPlus is global, with specific solution availability and restrictions by country. Please reference the sales guide for availability by country, which varies by AirPlus product.
Reference the sales guide below for details about selling this solution.
Clients can read about this solution in our marketplace: https://marketplace.bcdtravel.com.
Please use the following form to submit new leads: https://www.airplus.com/world/en/airplus/sales-lead/'),
('a2N7T000002BT38UAG', 'Morten Bundgaard', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Risk Management', 'A3M', 'Active', 'Booking', 'BCD Marketplace', 'A3M develops and operates the most effective early warning, information, and communication systems for the protection and security of assets.
