For more information, visit the marketplace https://marketplace.bcdtravel.com/'),
('a2NbG00000000G9UAI', 'Bridgett Fields', '0057R00000CA67uQAD', 'Tracking', 'Ticket Tracker', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Ticket Tracker is BCD''s owned, developed, and supported, global ticket asset management product via a self-service portal.'),
('a2NbG00000000RRUAY', 'Cherise George', '00520000001n6rvAAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'NORAM Centralized Operations Support', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'The Centralized Operations Support teamâ€™s purpose is to centralize and streamline operational processes within specialized operational support teams, allowing frontline operations teams to focus on consultants and customers. 

We assign a resource to represent operations management on all IPCM-led projects. During projects, we complete all operational tasks, check in with the operations owner along the way, and hand off the completed project details to the designated operations owner. We also centralize and manage some standard operational activities, including support of select operational tools, in effort to further free up operations leaders to focus on their consultants and customers.'),
('a2NbG00000000o1UAA', 'Bridgett Fields', '00520000001khqXAAQ', 'Notifications', 'Ticket Tracker Messages', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'We offer 3 traveler facing messages via the BCD Message Hub.  No account customization is available on these messages.'),
('a2NbG00000000pdUAA', 'Bridgett Fields', '00520000001khqXAAQ', 'Booking', 'Ticket Tracker Profile Feeds', 'Active', 'Customer', 'OBT', 'Unused assets are pushed to online booking tool and profile tools daily.  Where available, ticket data will be visible to the traveler via their OBT.'),
