As a service provider, we know that BCD Travel has an opportunity to learn from our mistakes. After researching and resolving customer concerns, our Customer Care Champions will document and code each case to ensure our trend reporting is actionable by other internal teams so we can prevent issues from reoccurring when possible.'),
