('a2NbG0000000PuTUAU', 'Jill Thomson', '00520000001l124AAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'Customer Experience Partner', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'The Customer Experience Partner team is an advocate for Elite 24 members and BCD Travel. We provide support to the Elite 24 consultant and management team, enrolled Elite 24 members and their officially designated guests with service recovery, and BCD Travel internal teams with inquiries and education regarding the Elite 24 service.'),
('a2NbG0000000Pw5UAE', 'Cherise George', '00520000001l124AAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'Deloitte Customer Care', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'The Deloitte Customer Care team understands that mistakes happen. Even if a mistake is made or there is a misunderstanding, most customers will be understanding and patient â€“ as long as we are able to address the problem and provide a solution quickly. We know that when exceptional service recovery is provided, we increase customer loyalty. We do this by acknowledging all customer concerns within one business day through a personal introduction email from a Customer Care Champion.'),
('a2NbG0000000PxhUAE', 'Cherise George', '00520000001l124AAA', 'Centralized Operations', 'ExxonMobil Customer Care', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'The ExxonMobil Customer Care team understands that mistakes happen. Even if a mistake is made or there is a misunderstanding, most customers will be understanding and patient â€“ as long as we are able to address the problem and provide a solution quickly. We know that when exceptional service recovery is provided, we increase customer loyalty. We do this by acknowledging all customer concerns within one business day through a personal introduction email from an ExxonMobil Customer Care Champion. The customer will receive a case update every 72 hours on all open cases, however we strive to resolve all cases within five business days.'),
('a2NbG0000000QTxUAM', 'Kelly Hunt', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Expense', 'Concur Expense Invoice Auto Forward', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Expense integration is made easier for SAP Concur integrated Travel & Expense clients.

