('a2NbG0000003K0bUAE', 'Michelle Ramirez', '005w00000060YA0AAM', 'Booking', 'TripSource Booking - Rail: UK Rail', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'Along with all the benefits of an itinerary management and traveler engagement platform, TripSource offers a proprietary booking solution providing a simplified digital experience for travelers. This is the perfect option for clients looking for a simple online booking solution thatâ€™s easy to implement and even easier to use. This record focuses on the availability of UK Rail.'),
('a2NbG0000003m3JUAQ', 'Courtney Kania', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Sustainability', 'Clarasight', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Clarasight is a sustainability solution for emissions reporting, forecasting, planning and management. More info coming soon!'),
('a2NbG00000040JBUAY', 'Julie Morales', '005bG00000Gs5eDQAR', 'BCD Pay', 'Automated Reconciliation - Full-Service Reconciliation', 'Active', 'Customer', 'T&E Spend Management', 'The process of verifying that a credit card transaction equals a charge that was approved through the travel program. BCD Travel credit card specialists review and upload a statement(s) into BCD Pay. After the initial automated matching process is complete, the credit card specialist researches unmatched and possible matched transactions against the travel program guidelines and manually matches transactions if the charges are verified. Any remaining unmatched transactions are handed over for further investigation or dispute. Outputs are standard reports and dashboards that contain verified credit card transactions with enhanced travel and reportable data side by side.'),
('a2NbG00000040RFUAY', 'Julie Morales', '005bG00000Gs5eDQAR', 'BCD Pay', 'Automated Reconciliation - Self-Service Reconciliation', 'Active', 'Customer', 'T&E Spend Management', 'The process of matching credit card transactions with travel data. Users upload a statement(s) into BCD Pay. Matching results can be full matches (card number, passenger name, ticket number, transaction date +/-, amount are equal), possible matches (only partial fields match), and unmatched transactions. Transactions that do not automatically match, must be manually reviewed and matched by the client outside of the system. 
Note: There is no support provided for researching unmatched transactions
Reportable fields, that were captured during the booking process, are attached to full and possible matches. Outputs are reports and dashboards that contain copies of credit card transactions and added travel and reportable data side by side.'),
('a2NbG0000004DMrUAM', 'Atef Boetel', '005w0000003CftoAAC', 'Booking', 'TripSource: booking powered by TripRacer', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'OBT', 'TripSource offers corporate clients in the Nordics the ability to access TripRacerâ€”a locally developed booking engine by Softinventorâ€”via single sign-on (SSO). Designed with regional needs in mind, TripRacer offers a modern, intuitive interface and localized content for booking flights, hotels, rail, and car rentals. Travelers will enter through TripSource, with TSPM handling profile management and the Travel Commerce Platform delivering hotel content.'),
('a2NbG0000004LfNUAU', 'Atef Boetel', '005w0000003CftoAAC', 'Booking', 'TripRacer Nordics (GOV & MIL)', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'OBT', 'TripRacer is an online booking tool powered by Softinventor, designed for govermental or military clients in Sweden. It provides a modern and intuitive interface for booking flights, hotels, rail, and car rentals.'),
('a2NbG0000004QiHUAU', 'Courtney Kania', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Visa & Passport', 'Visa365', 'Active', 'Booking', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Visa365 offers the easiest, fastest and cheapest way to obtain a business travel visa.'),
