('a2NbG0000005GvNUAU', 'Julie Suhard', '0052X000007u9kUQAQ', 'Booking', 'GetGoing - Go Travel&Expense', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'GetGoing', 'Go Travel&Expense includes all in Go Travel, plus:
