('a2NbG0000005qsPUAQ', 'Kelly Hunt', '00520000000nunmAAA', 'Booking', 'SkyLink', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'SkyLink is an AI-powered chat bot that lives inside our clientâ€™s enterprise chat channel (e.g., Slack and Teams). Travelers can chat with the SkyLink bot just like they would a colleague or favorite travel consultant, and get instant, personalized, and policy-compliant recommendations. The technology handles multi-leg trips, last-minute tweaks, and even quick questions in real time.'),
('a2NbG0000005uWDUAY', 'Courtney Kania', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Meeting Management', 'Certain', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'A realâ€‘time event engagement platform that turns interactions into revenue. Certain unifies event management, analytics, and CRM integration so teams can run consistent, scalable events and activate buyer intent instantly.'),
('a2NbG0000005ueHUAQ', 'Courtney Kania', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Rate Audit', 'Partnership Travel Consulting', 'Active', 'Booking', 'BCD Marketplace', 'PTC is part of a project  to get rate audit companies under legal contract.'),
('a2NbG0000005uhVUAQ', 'Nikki Harrington', '0057R00000CA509QAD', 'Booking', 'Hotel Price Assurance - Premium', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'TripSource Shopping & Booking', 'Hotel Price Assurance Premium is a customizable tool for clients to ensure they''re receiving the lowest available rates on hotel bookings with enhanced analytics. We monitor all reservations for price drops post booking up to the cancellation policy window.'),
