('a2NbG0000009BHBUA2', 'Nina Leyhe', '005bG00000MphSrQAJ', 'Sustainability', 'BCD Sustainability Solution', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'It''s a fully integrated solution that embeds carbon management throughout the entire corporate travel lifecycle: planning, booking, and reporting. It enables clients to define climate targets, steer traveler behavior, apply carbon-related charges, and track emissions consistently.â€¯ More information are available on the Sustainability Solution page on MySource: https://bcdglobal.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/solutions/SitePages/Sustainability_Solution.aspx?csf=1&web=1&e=VwbDsU'),
