('a2NbG000000Ca1JUAS', 'Katharina Fritzsche', '0057T000002OMFAQA4', 'Service Design', 'BCD EMEA Basic VIP Service', 'Active', 'Booking', 'Centralized Operations', 'This is the standard VIP Service for EMEA countries. It can be implemented via a OT case and will be offline only. For clients with individual requirements for their VIP Service, please follow the process for a complete implementation project.'),
('a2NbG000000CcCnUAK', 'Hannah Kahn', '005w00000060YA0AAM', 'Booking', 'TripSource Booking - Rail: SBB CFF FFS', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'Along with all the benefits of an itinerary management and traveler engagement platform, TripSource offers a proprietary booking solution providing a simplified digital experience for travelers. This is the perfect option for clients looking for a simple online booking solution thatâ€™s easy to implement and even easier to use. This record focuses on the availability of SBB CFF FFS.'),
('a2NbG000000DfyDUAS', 'Laurent Schouteten', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Meeting Management', 'EventIT', 'Active', 'Booking', 'BCD Marketplace', 'This partner is in active onboarding. Information coming soon.'),
('a2NbG000000DqFJUA0', 'Courtney Kania', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Expense', 'Declaree by Mobilexpense', 'In Development', 'Ticketing', 'BCD Marketplace', 'Mid-size business solution: Declaree by Mobilexpense
Optimised for simpler expense needs and regional roll-outs, Declaree provides a mobile and desktop application for receipt capture, mileage logging and company-card integration. With business cards and automated workflows, it offers a user-friendly, compliant alternative to paper/manual processes.'),
