('a2NbG000000E0BRUA0', 'Courtney Kania', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Disruption Services', 'AirRefund (Yource)', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'AirRefund makes it easier than ever to claim compensation for delayed, cancelled, and overbooked flights. Passengers can claim up to â‚¬600 per disrupted journey.
AirRefund is a brand of Yource â€” one of the oldest and most experienced air passenger rights organizations in the world. Since 2010, we have helped over a million passengers claim their well-deserved flight compensation, based on the European and British regulations.'),
('a2Nw000000024adEAA', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Bargain Finder Max', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Bargain Finder Max is a product used by Online Booking Tools which sorts and display hundreds of low fare options for single or multiple airport combinations. 

*Breadth of options â€“ In a single request, you can request 50, 100, or 200 low-fare options for all simple trips and 50 low-fare options for all multi-destination trips worldwide.

*Customized Shopping â€“ You can customize your shopping requests by using qualifiers to promote flights based on different options including carrierâ€™s preferences, schedules, and flight duration''s.

*Alternate City Shopping â€“ You can process low-fare options using either a mileage radius within 100 miles or by specifying the alternate city.

*Calendar Shopping â€“ You can search alternate dates plus or minus one or three days from your original travel dates for North American points of sale and itineraries.'),
('a2Nw000000024aiEAA', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Branded Fares', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Shop, book and fulfill airline products using the same benefits that airlines market to end users. Branded Fares include simplified attributes that allow you to sell to your customers based on values other than lowest price.

*Consistent and reliable results from a single sales channel
Increase your revenues by selling higher brand options. Use matrix to compare brand value and offering at a glance. Take advantage of textual and graphical comparison of branded fares. Find out important information just by hovering over powerful point-of-sale text boxes.

*Knowledge of airline products
Remain the expert of the industry with current information on airline products while communicating the brand message to your customers.

*Comparison and search options
View branded fares in Fare Quote display. With optional parameters you can explore multiple brands per itinerary and price them based on brand ID. Get branded fares returned in shopping display and specific brand attributes'),
('a2Nw000000024uwEAA', 'Matthew Costello', '00520000001oCiCAAU', 'Unknown', 'Amadeus Unused Ticket Tracker Plus', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Amadeus Unused Ticket Tracker Plus is a powerful tool that allows customers to track unused electronic tickets, offering cost savings to the customer and traveler. The use of this tool reduces the time spent on manual checks of electronic tickets, and it provides customers the flexibility and convenience of making requests by using various options, such as request by agency account number, Amadeus Record Locator & Office ID'),
('a2Nw000000024vkEAA', 'Inactive User', '00520000001khv5AAA', 'Unknown', 'Rail Outsourcing', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Fulfilment of rail bookings through shared service centre'),
('a2Nw00000009wwyEAA', 'Matthew Costello', '00520000001oCiCAAU', 'Unknown', 'Amadeus Ticket Changer (ATC) - Reissue', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Amadeus Ticket Changer (ATC) is the Amadeus Solution to automate the calculation necessary to reissue a ticket. Amadeus Ticket Changer also stores the results in correct ticketing formats. It delivers quicker and more responsive services to travel needs and changes of your customers.'),
('a2Nw00000009wx3EAA', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'TripCase', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'TripCase Connect is a web and mobile tool keeping agencies connected with travelers through confirmation emails, branded documents and in-app messages.'),
('a2Nw00000009wx8EAA', 'Matthew Costello', '00520000001oCiCAAU', 'Unknown', 'Amadeus Ticket Changer (ATC) - Involuntary', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Generates a re-issue document in case of involuntary changes due to airlines strike, extraordinary weather conditions, a schedule change or anything else due to an airlines decision not to fly as originally booked.'),
('a2Nw00000009wxDEAQ', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Travelport Rapid Reprice for Worldspan', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Rapid Reprice for Worldspan automates the complex ticket reissue process with speed and accuracy. This product is activated at the PCC level and is activated as a standard for all BCD PCCs.'),
('a2Nw00000009wxSEAQ', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Apollo', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'GDS', 'Travelport GDS no longer available'),
('a2Nw00000009wxXEAQ', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Galileo', 'Active', 'Booking', 'GDS', 'Travelport GDS available in all countries'),
('a2Nw00000009wxcEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Worldspan', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'GDS', 'Travelport GDS available globally'),
('a2Nw00000009wxhEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Travelport Automated Exchanges (Rapid Reprice Galileo)', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Rapid Reprice for Galileo automates the complex ticket reissue process with speed and accuracy. This application is an add-on to Galileo Desktop and Smartpoint and should be installed after these software products are installed, and should be installed as a standard for Galileo users.'),
('a2Nw00000009wxmEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Apollo - Automated Refunds & Exchanges (ARNE)', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Automated Refunds and Exchanges (ARNE) is the desktop solution for Apollo that fully automates airline ticket exchanges and refund calculations. Elminating this time-consuming manual process makes your agents more productive and efficient and eliminates data entry errors that are inherent to manual processing.

ARNE is activated at the PCC level and is activated as a standard for all BCD PCCs.'),
('a2Nw00000009x48EAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport eNett VANs', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'A secure and cost effective virtual card solution that facilitates payments to airlines, hotels, car rental companies and other suppliers to eliminate the risk of misuse. Available for Apollo, Galileo and Worldspan GDS users.'),
('a2Nw00000009x4DEAQ', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport Booking Feed (TBF)', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'A proprietary data source that collects both pre- and post- ticketing data from the Apollo and Galileo systems (formerly GIDS).

This product is in limited use at BCD and typically implemented at client request.'),
('a2Nw00000009x4IEAQ', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport e-Tracker', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'A powerful e-ticket management solution for tracking, monitoring and generating reports on the status of all e-tickets issued by your agency. Available for Apollo, Galileo and Worldspan.

This is a chargeable product and implemented upon request. Generally, to be used in regions without another method of e-ticket tracking.'),
('a2Nw00000009x4NEAQ', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport Journey Reporter', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Allows you to track and monitor in real-time the whereabouts of corporate travelers - no matter where they''ve been or where they''re going'),
('a2Nw00000009x4SEAQ', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Travelport Net Fare Manager', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'With Travelport''s Net Fare Manager tool, net fares distributed by the airlines via ATPCO and SITA are automatically aggregated where you can qucikly see and manage all your net fares

This product is not implemented by PCC and should not be included in new business implementations.'),
('a2Nw00000009x4cEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Travelport Agency Private Fares', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'A web-based fares management and distribution solution for the private fares of Travelport-connected retailers, corporations and web sites.'),
('a2Nw00000009x4hEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport Rooms & More', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Travelport Rooms and More is a hotel meta search integrated solution for travel agents.

An innovative solution that offers access to a wide variety of accommodations around the world. It doesn''t matter which GDS - or if any GDS at all. You have the freedom to shop and book bed and breakfasts, boutiques, five-star deluxe hotels, budget accommodations and everything in between. Travelport Rooms and More also features a streamlined commission payment process that delivers monthly payments in your local currency.'),
('a2Nw00000009x4mEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport Mobile Agent', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Travelport Mobile Agentâ„¢  lets your  tablet or smartphone become your sales partner to gain access to Galileo, Apollo or Worldspan'),
('a2Nw00000009x4rEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport ViewTrip', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Flexible online itinerary that provides travelers 24/7 access to complete itinerary information including flight confirmation numbers, departure and arrival times, electronic ticket information, flight duration and mileage, on-time flight status, meal information, hotels, car rentals, destination maps, weather, driving directions and more.'),
('a2Nw00000009x4wEAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Booking', 'Travelport ViewTrip Mobile', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'An itinerary management tool that works with the Travelport ViewTrip website to push travel itineraries to your customersâ€™ iPhone or Android mobile devices â€“ offering flexible itinerary management, service and support across all stages of their journeys.'),
('a2Nw00000009x51EAA', 'Renee Dorminy', '00520000001khqMAAQ', 'Unknown', 'Travelport Queue Manager', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Queue Manager is a productivity-building application that totally automates the management of queues â€“ an otherwise time-consuming manual process. Queue Manager allows supervisors and agents to move Booking Files (PNRs) from one queue to another, print or free any Booking Files that are on queue. The system performs a number of useful operations on queues to speed up your agency processes and increase productivity.

This product is included in the Galileo Desktop and Smartpoint software installation.'),
('a2Nw00000009xSsEAI', 'Larisa Sokolova', '00520000001ky5eAAA', 'Booking', 'BCD Time Aero', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'Local Online Booking Tool available in Russia.'),
('a2Nw00000009xT7EAI', 'Cecile Soulier', '005w0000004yE2dAAE', 'Unknown', 'NP4 - TD Care', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Traveler Security', 'TD care makes personal travel information  accessible. Corporations
locate their business travelers around the world at all times: before, during and after the trip'),
('a2Nw00000009xUKEAY', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Quality Control - QCE Technology', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Agent-Facing', 'Full suite of technology for partner countries including Compleat and the QCE desktop application
Set of routines designed to run on PNRS for 3 levels:
     - BCD Travel:  These routines run for all BCD Travel PNRS
     - Country:  These routines run for all PNRs in a country
