('a2Nw00000009xUPEAY', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Quality Control - Full Technology', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Agent-Facing', 'Full suite of technology for wholly owned countries including but not limited to Compleat, Point-of-Sale tools and Strategic Operations.
Set of routines designed to run on PNRS for 3 levels:
     - BCD Travel:  These routines run for all BCD Travel PNRS
     - Country:  These routines run for all PNRs in a country
