('a2Nw00000009xUUEAY', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Fare Module', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Searches for lower available fares on each stored fare in the PNR. 
 If lower fares are found to be available, the PNR is documented and queued back to the account for action.'),
('a2Nw00000009xUyEAI', 'Inactive User', '005w0000004yE2dAAE', 'Unknown', 'Airbnb Business Data Feed', 'Active', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Reporting & Analytics', 'We''ve built an integration with Airbnb for Business, giving mutual customers the ability to include Airbnb Business bookings in their duty of care program. These bookings will be included in security reporting. For more information, please see internal documentation section.'),
('a2Nw00000009yKMEAY', 'Malin Knutstedt', '005w0000006u2AZAAY', 'Booking', 'BCD Travel Direct - Onesto', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'A standardised online booking solution for clients in Germany that want to book themselves online but also have access to travel consultants'),
('a2Nw00000009ziUEAQ', 'Gabi Gates', '005w0000005p7yfAAA', 'Booking', 'Concur Travel Standard - Direct', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'Concur Travel "Standard" is a off the shelf paired down version of the Enterprise edition of Concur Travel.  This version still a online booking tool that enables employees of an organization to book flight, hotel, rail and car reservations.  Travel content is delivered based on defined corporate policies and individual traveler preferences.  This version has limited choices when setting up.'),
('a2Nw00000009zqBEAQ', 'Laurent Schouteten', '00520000001knzDAAQ', 'Booking', 'KDS - Reseller', 'Inactive', 'Ticketing', 'OBT', 'N/A'),
('a2Nw00000009ztKEAQ', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice PNR Data Mining', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Reporting designed to locate travelers potentially during times of crisis or disaster, i.e. hurricanes, earthquakes, etc. 

This includes PNR Repository, DecisionSource Security, Third Party PNR Distribution, i.e. ISOS, iJet, etc.'),
('a2Nw00000009ztPEAQ', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'Compleat Quality Control - EMEA Tree', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Set of routines designed to run on PNRS at EMEA level.  These routines have been chosen specifically to work for wholly owned countries.'),
('a2Nw00000009ztUEAQ', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Traveler Communication', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Travel related emails:  This is the travel receipt which contains the travel details, ticket number with price and the Travel Itinerary with travel details

Product and specific emails:  These are designed for use by specific processes and advise travelers when specific travel scenarios exist

Value added:  This includes notifications such as passport expiration, form of payment expiration, fare quotes, reconfirmations etc.'),
('a2Nw00000009ztZEAQ', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Seat Module', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Designed to check for better seats assignments when preferred seating is not available at the time the reservation was booked. If the travelers preferred seating is found to be available, Compleat will confirm the new seat. The PNR will be documented and queued back to the account for follow up.'),
('a2Nw00000009zteEAA', 'Tracy Osborn', '00520000001kn0nAAA', 'Unknown', 'Orders Automation Ticket Tracker', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'BCD owned, developed, and supported, global ticket asset management product that provides a modern automated solution of a reports, profile feeds and traveler notifications.'),
('a2Nw00000009ztjEAA', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Auto Ticketing', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Facilitates ticketing in an agent touchless environment if applicable in the market.'),
('a2Nw00000009ztoEAA', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Local Ticketing', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Routine that is used to generate tickets.  It is available for use if applicable in the market.'),
('a2Nw00000009zuhEAA', 'Sydjea Ridgard', '00520000001ki1lAAA', 'Unknown', 'MidOffice Online Touchless', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Mid Office', 'Set of routines designed to provide fulfillment from online booking tools via Compleat.'),
('a2Nw0000000A0RJEA0', 'Alexander Crouse', '00520000001kn0tAAA', 'Tracking', 'CAPP Global', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'CAPP Global is a reporting tool (not necessarily used for billing or used for a PNR). It is being used by a variety of teams to record their â€œworkâ€ into a database. Some of these teams do not have a GDS nor do they work PNRs, but use the tool to record their work/tasks.'),
('a2Nw0000000A0iiEAC', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Air Extras', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Easy way to book ancillary services.
Air Extras provides a straightforward method to display and book any add-ons offered by airlines. Use convenient qualifiers and entries to match what is available with what the travellers want.'),
('a2Nw0000000A0inEAC', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Automated Exchange (SAE)', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', '- Workflow efficiency and accuracy tool to assist you in complicated situations.
Automated Exchanges takes care of the ticket change process.  Save time, protect revenue, enhance productivity and improve accuracy. Automated Exchanges helps you to do all of the above. 

- Revenue protection
Donâ€™t worry about the losses that manual ticket change can result in. Automated Exchanges is included in SabreÂ® Fare Guarantee Policy to safeguard your revenues.
 
- Better customer service and top-level productivity
Automated Exchanges updates the price of the changed itinerary in seconds, improving your efficiency and accuracy.  Training burden is reduced due ease-of-use.  The previously complex ticket change process becomes easy and available to everyone, allowing you to maximize your resources, and your profits.'),
('a2Nw0000000A0isEAC', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Automated Ticketing', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', '- Easily issue tickets
Automated Ticketing provides efficient issuance of airline tickets, travel documents and passenger receipts. IATA accreditation and knowledge about fares, pricing and ticketing are necessary.'),
('a2Nw0000000AF4uEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Java Print Module (SJPM)', 'Inactive', 'Ticketing', 'Agent-Facing', 'The SabreÂ® Java Printing Module (SJPM) version 1.9.2 is a 32-Bit, Java-based printing application that replaces the legacy Sabre Print Module (SPM aka OADP) and its functionality.

 SJPM has been developed as a Java-based printing application for the secure delivery of print data from the SabreÂ® Host to the Client print device. 

The Sabre Java Print Module provides the ability to connect the Sabre host to a physical printer or back office application (IUR, eticket receipt, agent coupon and refund notice).'),
('a2Nw0000000AI12EAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Booking', 'Sabre Red 360', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'The New SabreÂ® Redâ„¢ Workspace will bring an upgrade to existing SRW users.

Sabre will make this new platform available for Global TMC''s in early 2018.
  
For questions, please contact Natalie Breedt.'),
('a2Nw0000000AJNcEAO', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Automated Refunds (SAR)', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Automated Refunds utilizes the Category 33 Voluntary Refunds rules filed by the airline and apply these rules when determining the value to refund, including the applicable cancel fee.

This product will attempt to apply Category 33 rules in the following conditions:

    Ticket issued in Sabre GDS
    Electronic ticket (not paper)
    Ticket issued using automated pricing (i.e. not manually priced)
    Original issue (not previously exchanged)
    Public and private fares, excluding Net Remit method types
    Ticket issued with FOP'),
('a2Nw0000000AJNrEAO', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Descriptive Billing Information (DBI)', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Agent-Facing', 'Descriptive Billing Information (DBI) allows you to add descriptive billing information to the PNR prior to 
ticketing.  This information is required for some credit cards:

American Express(AX) - cards beginning with 37XX9 followed by eleven digits.
 - 37 - denotes American Express
 - XX - country code
 - 9  - denotes corporate product

AirPlus (TP)
 - usually required forcards beginning with numbers 1220, and 1920-1929

You may enter this information via a mask or with a linear format.
You may also enter this information for Corporate and Blocked Space Group (BSG) bookings.'),
('a2Nw0000000ALcREAW', 'Utkarsh Khanna', '005w0000005gbCEAAY', 'Booking', 'Serko Business Online - Reseller', 'Inactive', 'Ticketing', 'OBT', 'N/A'),
('a2Nw0000000ALnsEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Virtual Payment Hotel', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Sabre Virtual Payments - Hotel is a Sabre Red App that securely automates the supplier payment and reconciliation process by deploying an on demand single use virtual card number at the point of sale. The use of virtual cards reduces expenses by automating manual intensive processes, reduces fraud, integrates with multiple banking partners and card networks, and is PCI compliant.'),
('a2Nw0000000ALnxEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Virtual Payments LCC', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'The Sabre Virtual Payments LCC Air is a Sabre Red App that generates virtual cards for low cost carrier bookings, which have specific booking and payment processes. The app requests and receives virtual card credentials, which can then in turn be used to complete the booking and payment processes for low cost carrier transactions. The Sabre Virtual Payments LCC Air App brings together the virtual card security benefits, and enhanced virtual card credentials, to offer a streamlined booking and payment solution for low cost carriers'),
('a2Nw0000000ALo2EAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Virtual Payment FOP', 'Inactive', 'Ticketing', 'Agent-Facing', 'Sabre Virtual Payment FOP integrates virtual payment technology into the agency workflow, providing a seamless payment process. The â€˜Virtual Payment FOPâ€™ core system integration functionality will allow virtual card issuance to be streamlined as a standard form of payment type, removing the need to make workflow changes to adopt virtual cards.'),
('a2Nw0000000ALo7EAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Virtual Payment Air', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Sabre Virtual Payments - Air is a Sabre Red App that securely automates the supplier payment and reconciliation process by deploying an on demand single use virtual card number at the point of sale. The use of virtual cards reduces expenses by automating manual intensive processes, reduces fraud, integrates with multiple banking partners and card networks, and is PCI compliant.'),
('a2Nw0000000ALoCEAW', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Virtual Payment Sabre Rail', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Sabre Rail (Amtrak and U.K. train line)
Sabre Virtual Payments is an innovative technology, now available via the Sabre Rail Amtrak Red app. Sabre Virtual Payments provides a unique virtual card number that is generated on demand for a specific travel event, helping to control travel program costs and prevent fraud. The electronically obtained number includes an expiration date and CVV. Virtual card numbers can only be used for a specific amount and within a specified date range â€“ making fraud nearly impossible.'),
('a2Nw0000000ALoHEAW', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Virtual Payment Ticketer', 'Inactive', 'Ticketing', 'Agent-Facing', 'SabreÂ® Virtual Payments Ticketer a Sabre Travel Network desktop software application that automates air and rail ticketing functions using a virtual credit card number form of payment. It has been developed using the SabreÂ® QikTM Developer version 7.1.'),
('a2Nw0000000GEdfEAG', 'Klaus Goddard', '00520000000pxBBAAY', 'Booking', 'CTM', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'Brazil specific Online Booking Tool'),
('a2Nw0000000GEdkEAG', 'Utkarsh Khanna', '005w0000005gbCEAAY', 'Booking', 'Serko - Reseller', 'Inactive', 'Ticketing', 'OBT', 'Online Booking Tool in APAC - DO NOT SELL - Contract expired wef Q1''21'),
('a2Nw0000000GF9MEAW', 'Jacqueline Hallt', '00520000001lZpPAAU', 'Trip Authorization', 'Trip Authorizer Professional', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'TripSource Policy Guidance', 'A flexible, web-based pre-ticketing trip authorization solution. Trip Authorizer determines if an authorization is required and guides traditional and online bookings through the authorization process.  Available in all countries except China (and Brazil if they are using CTM).'),
