('a2Nw0000000GF9WEAW', 'Greg Powell', '00520000001kn0pAAA', 'Booking', 'Single Sign On (SSO) OBT - Reseller', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'Implementation/maintenance assistance of traveler single sign on (SSO) into OBT for reseller OBT contracts.  This is direct SSO from customer intranet to OBT and separate from TripSource/OBT Connect.'),
