('a2Nw0000000GIUJEA4', 'John Hudson', '00520000001lgRFAAY', 'Unknown', 'IRD / DMED', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'The International Rate Desk is global team of experts that are trained in the application of creative fare construction, tariff interpretations and routing alternatives for international air itineraries.'),
('a2Nw0000000GJmmEAG', 'Jonathan Kao', '005w0000006blN1AAI', 'Booking', 'Tripsource CN', 'Active', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'TripSource China is BCD''s proprietary online booking tool and mobile app designed specifically for our corporate clients in China. It is a fully functional platform that allows travelers to book and manage their travel itineraries, including domestic and international flights, hotels, and domestic rail. In addition to these functionalities, TripSource China also includes real-time car hailing services and a trip approval function that enables managers to approve or reject travel requests from their employees. It is available in the form of a web version, IOS and Android for the APP and HTML 5. With a user-friendly interface and seamless integration with BCD''s travel management services, TripSource China is the go-to tool for booking corporate travel in China.'),
('a2Nw0000000GKEcEAO', 'Nikki Harrington', '0057R00000CA509QAD', 'Booking', 'Hotel Price Assurance - Core', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'TripSource Shopping & Booking', 'Hotel Price Assurance Core is our default, standard tool for all clients ensuring the lowest available rates on hotel bookings. We monitor all reservations for price drops post booking up to the cancellation policy window. Both the Core Default and Core Alternate configurations are HPA Core and follow the same market availability found in this record. Consider the Premium offering if your customer wants a customizable solution.'),
('a2Nw0000000GKEhEAO', 'Jaimie Johnson', '005w00000060YA0AAM', 'Unknown', 'Hotel Price Assurance - (Professional Package-Inactive)', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'TripSource Shopping & Booking', 'UPDATE (04/20/2018) PLEASE DO NOT SELL / OFFER TO CUSTOMERS.  PLEASE REFER TO ENTERPRISE OFFERING. 

Product related questions or support? Engage Solutions Consulting, first.

Hotel Price Assurance ensures our customers get the best rates by automatically shopping for lower rates after booking.   

Our Professional Package includes everything in the Business Package with a few configuration options:

â€¢ Exclude traveler PNRs based on up to three fields (such as VIP, international or DK numbers)
â€¢ Opt in or out of the traveler''s itinerary notice that the rate is being monitored
â€¢ Opt in or out of the traveler email advising that their hotel has been re-booked at a lower rate
â€¢ Opt to add the client''s logo to the traveler email

NOTE: This product is LAUNCHED only in North America.'),
('a2Nw0000000KLeOEAW', 'Lynne Niemi', '005w0000004knwcAAA', 'Unknown', 'NextGen Itinerary & Email Redesign', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Mid Office', 'At BCD Travel, we are committed to transforming the traveler experience â€“ transitioning to consumer-friendly tools and services and a more casual â€œnon-corporateâ€ tone of voice that engages the traveler and influences behaviors. 

