('a2Nw0000000Pjg7EAC', 'Hannah Kahn', '005w00000060YA0AAM', 'Interactive Communications', 'TripSource Messaging Program', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'TripSource Policy Guidance', 'The TripSource messaging program offers a direct and intuitive communication channel for clients'' traveling employees.  Clients can provide information and reminders that drive good travel choices and make the key elements of their  travel policy easily available and understood when travelers need it. Through push notifications, SMS messaging and in-app updates, TripSource keeps travelers connected and informed throughout their travel experience.'),
('a2Nw0000000QUVZEA4', 'Morten Bundgaard', '005bG000008l0KyQAI', 'Risk Management', 'Anvil', 'Active', 'Customer', 'BCD Marketplace', 'The ANVIL Group is a security and crisis avoidance specialist, offering a full range of physical, technological, and information security services. BCD Travel partners with The ANVIL Group to provide enhanced TRM solutions to our clients. These range from premium risk intelligence, enhanced traveler and device tracking to medical and security assistance, crisis response and protection services.  

