('a2Nw0000000QWjGEAW', 'Julie Morales', '0057R00000BoqfnQAB', 'BCD Pay', 'Credit Card Reconciliation', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'T&E Spend Management', 'This has been replaced by the Automated Reconciliation Self-Service Reconciliation record - please see the correct record

