('a2Nw0000000QWjLEAW', 'Jorge Mesa', '00520000001khwvAAA', 'Briefings & Alerts', 'Global Crisis Management', 'Active', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Traveler Security', 'Global Crisis Management (GCM) is dedicated to identifying incidents that might affect our business travelers around the world.  We execute crisis response plans, identifying clients that could potentially be affected by a major incident, and guide our organization when the situation occurs. We provide booking reports, consolidate information and coordinate teams from around the company in order to assist the needs of our client and their travelers. 

We provide coverage 24 hours, 365 days a year, with team members placed around the world. Weâ€™re always available to provide internal teams support and guidance, and answer questions to our services in Travel Risk management. 

You can send your questions to us by email at  global.crisis.management@bcdtravel.com'),
('a2Nw0000000QWjQEAW', 'Yvonne Quicksell', '00520000001khz7AAA', 'Disruption Services', 'Intelliguide - Risk Alert Subscriptions', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Traveler Security', 'BCD Travel offers traveler alerts (GoAlerts) using features form Intelliguide, powered by Northstar Travel Media. GoAlerts deliver breaking security and travel alerts via email directly to travel managers and travel agents, who can then alert their clients and employees. Subscribers may filter delivery of security and travel news alerts by destination, urgency level, category , significant travel impact and more.'),
('a2Nw0000000QWjVEAW', 'Kate Trahan Shirley', '0052X000007osqKQAQ', 'Disruption Services', 'PNR Based Incident - Risk Alerts', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Traveler Security', 'We offer PNR based incident/risk alerts for DecisionSource Security clients through Northstar Media.'),
