('a2Nw0000000QWjfEAG', 'Sandra Ling', '005w0000005zrp5AAA', 'Unknown', 'Concur Intelligence', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Reporting & Analytics', 'Concur Intelligence is Concurâ€™s Business Intelligence solution. A platform, which consolidates TMC -, expense-, invoice-, ERP- and credit card data for a combined view into spending. Concur intelligence offers ad-hoc, scheduled and alert based reporting and self service dashboards. 
