('a2Nw0000000QWmoEAG', 'Marcel de Wit', '005w0000005zrp5AAA', 'Expense', 'American Express Cards', 'Active', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Payment & Expense', 'BCD Travel has a long term relationship with American Express Cards. Since 2003 we promote AMEX cards in 25+ countries and in Germany we have a co-branded Corporate card and BTA with AMEX. This relationship gives all included BCD Travel countries the opportunity to promote AMEX cards to clients and in return BCD Travel will receive a billing based incentive from AMEX for three years. If you have a question please contact the team at payment@bcdtravel.com .

