('a2Nw0000000QYYOEA4', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Advisory Services', 'Advito - Consulting Services', 'Active', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'MySource Link:  https://bcdglobal.sharepoint.com/sites/solutions/SitePages/Advito.aspx

