('a2Nw0000000QsHLEA0', 'OLIVIER Benoit', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Performance Management', 'Advito - Dynamic Performance Management', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Advitoâ€™s Dynamic Performance Management is a holistic and proactive approach to travel program management.  Through ongoing program analysis, we uncover savings opportunities and offer advice for continuous improvement. We consider all moving parts â€“ from market dynamics to supplier negotiations to traveler behavior â€“ to find ways to enhance your program for the highest possible return.
