('a2Nw0000000R2uoEAC', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Booking', 'Sabre Red Mobile Workspace', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Sabre Red Mobile Workspace allows you to connect to Sabre Travel Marketplace using your iPad, and gives you freedom to work from any location with access to the Internet. Book and manage your customersâ€™ requests and support your agencyâ€™s operations even when you are on the go, as the app provides access to Air, Car and Hotel Shopping & Booking, PNR servicing, seat maps, ticketing capabilities, queues, Agency eServices and more commonly used agent functions. Sabre Red Mobile Workspace is an app specifically designed for iPads, utilizing the latest iOS technology to optimize your user experience.

Sabre Red Mobile Workspace is not compatible with Scribe scripts or BCD Point of Sale so users must be confident with cryptic Sabre commands.'),
('a2Nw0000000RCceEAG', 'Jorge Mesa', '00520000001khwvAAA', 'Advisory Services', 'Travel Risk Management Consulting', 'Active', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Traveler Security', 'We leverage our broad expertise to offer Travel Risk Management Consulting services designed to empower organizations to develop comprehensive travel safety and security programs.
Our Traveler Security Program Assessment (TSPA) will help a client bring their travel risk management program to the next level and aligned with ISO31030. Based on leading security research and best-in-class programs, our experts will assess the clientâ€™s current program state, guide the client and their stakeholders through a one-day, onsite discovery session. An assessment report will thoroughly document the results and action items and will be handed off to the client as a permanent reference.
Advitoâ€™s Travel Risk Management Sourcing Support streamlines the process from tailored RFP development to vendor evaluation and selection to expert negotiation and contract support.
In addition our experts specialize in crafting customized Travel Risk Management Policy tailored to the organization''s culture.'),
('a2Nw0000000RMdTEAW', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Event Notification Services (ENS)', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Event Notification Services utilizes Sabre Web Services to enhance the value of your most important asset - information. Instantly know about changes in PNRs + queues to proactively provide superior customer experiences.'),
('a2Nw0000000RMdYEAW', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Format Finder', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Easily find formats and other helpful information on the Sabre GDS in Format Finder. This searchable reference will assist you whether you are a new or experienced agent.'),
('a2Nw0000000RMddEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Graphical View', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Experience the Sabre travel marketplace with the flexibility of Sabre Red Workspace graphical view. Agents can shop and book air, car, hotel, merchandizing offers and email travel options using a fully graphical workflow that is easy to use.'),
('a2Nw0000000RMdiEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Personal Trainer', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Build expertise in booking air, cars, hotels, cruises and more with Personal Trainer. This multimedia experience allows you to train at your own pace and achieve mastery. Personal Trainer is free of charge for all Sabre Connected Agencies.

Available in these languages: Chinese -HongKong SAR; Chinese -RepubChina; English; French; German; Italian; Portuguese; Spanish'),
('a2Nw0000000RMdnEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Booking', 'Quality Control & Ticketing', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'Agent-Facing', 'Automate a high percentage of quality control and ticketing functions with Quality Control and Ticketing. This is ideal for larger, high-volume travel agencies that want to automate these processes.'),
('a2Nw0000000RMdsEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Branch Access', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Branch Access provides approved agency locations access to your agency records, customer profiles, or full access to your pseudo city code through triple A capability. There are four levels of Branch Access to choose from to meet your business needs.'),
('a2Nw0000000RMdxEAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Global Security', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'As an agent or consolidator, grant viewership and/or update PNR and profile information worldwide. This feature is used as alternative to opening branch access.'),
('a2Nw0000000RSvuEAG', 'Rupesh Parmar', '0057R00000BoqfnQAB', 'Payment', 'Virtual Payment Automation Low Cost Carrier (LCC)', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'T&E Spend Management', 'You may know Virtual Payment Automation (VPA) for hotel? We are using the same product and vision for Low cost carriers (LCC). Our vision is to make payment & expense invisible for business travelers.

VPA LCC is Simple. Secure. Automated.
â€¢	SIMPLE. For travelers who donâ€™t have to pay nor claim their expense.
â€¢	SECURE. Spend allowance and merchant type are restricted. The card can be used only once.
â€¢	AUTOMATED. For each booking, a unique virtual credit card number is deployed from BoookingBuilder

VPA for LCC is recommended for clients who want to pay for Low Cost Carriers centrally using their own virtual credit card. Our clientâ€™s objective might be either protecting their travelers from fraud, removing credit liability from them or they might be after easier travel data reconciliation.

VPA for LCC is launched in the U.K first as First Movers and this is is an off-line offer.'),
('a2Nw0000000RUcyEAG', 'Matthew Costello', '00520000001oCiCAAU', 'Unknown', 'Amadeus Mini Rules', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Mini rules are short and easy-to-read structured summary of the most important restrictions attached to a fare rules attached to a fare, and are displayed in the fare conditions window.

Mini rules provide you with simplified purchase conditions, pointing out the most important information about changes, cancellation, refund, advance purchase, minimum and maximum stay restrictions of the chosen fare'),
('a2Nw0000000RUd3EAG', 'Matthew Costello', '00520000001oCiCAAU', 'Unknown', 'Amadeus Master Pricer Expert', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Amadeus Master Pricer Expert is a multi channel travel search engine that helps you find the right fares fast. Built for the Amadeus Selling Platform, Amadeus API or Web Services and Amadeus e-Travel Management, itâ€™s a comprehensive solution that provides fast, flexible and accurate airline fare searches.'),
('a2Nw0000000RWi9EAG', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Automation Hub', 'Active', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Automation Hub automates agenciesâ€™ operations and processes, like schedule changes and itinerary notifications, so agents can concentrate on more profitable activities.'),
('a2Nw0000000RWiEEAW', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'Sabre Red App Clipboard', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'Agent-Facing', 'Save valuable time when creating customer trip proposals with Clipboard! Clipboard quickly translates information from Sabre Red Workspace Classic View into an easy-to-read format for the end traveler, including flight information like times, airlines, city codes, and even fares. Configure the trip proposal template to meet your individual needs, including adding your agency logo, contact information, choose your colors and font styles, and add any service fee or markup. Then simply copy from the Clipboard Red App and paste into an email or Word document. Itineraries can be sent in both plain text and HTML.'),
('a2Nw0000000btuvEAA', 'John Johnstonbaugh', '0057R00000CA67uQAD', 'Booking', 'Air Price Assurance (APA)  - Premium Plus', 'Active', 'Booking', 'TripSource Shopping & Booking', 'Overview
