('a2Nw0000000bx9lEAA', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Sourcing', 'Advito - Air', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Advitoâ€™s veteran air sourcing experts are joined by renowned experts in meetings, technology, policy, behavior and digital marketing. We evaluate and improve air program design overall, or zoom in on any of these individual elements as they relate to air spend.'),
('a2Nw0000000bx9qEAA', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Sourcing', 'Advito - Ground', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Corporate travel is changing, and old ways wonâ€™t open new doors. Advito''s experts produce useful, actionable spend management options with a holistic approach that combines advanced analytics, complete visibility, and expert insights. With Advito, you get the framework and resources you need to source the right suppliers, maximize corporate travel program performance, minimize spend and maintain the highest value agreements. We help travel managers align supply and demand across air, hotels, rail, car, and integrated meetings management categories.'),
('a2Nw0000000bx9vEAA', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Payment', 'Advito - Payment Optimization', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Payment & Expense', 'The payment landscape is rapidly evolving, and there is a tremendous opportunity to leverage payment technologies and applications to deliver new and innovative corporate travel payment solutions that will optimize payments to generate costs savings and higher rebates, deliver internal efficiencies, and improve the travelerâ€™s experience. With Advito, you can benchmark against best practices, optimize travel payments and processes to drive efficiencies, improve the traveler payment experience, and be prepared for regulatory changes.'),
('a2Nw0000000bxA0EAI', 'Amy Bryan', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Advisory Services', 'Advito - Meetings', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Advitoâ€™s unique and renowned meetings practice is an unbiased, modern solution to meetings program performance. Itâ€™s unbiased because it is offered independent of M&I service sales.  And itâ€™s pioneering the trail to integrated travel and meetings (ITM) â€“ and offering services beyond traditional meetings sourcing engagements'),
('a2Nw0000000bxA5EAI', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Performance Management', 'Advito - Outsourced Travel Management', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Different from the traditional Outsourced Travel Manager solution provided by our competitors, Advito provides clients with a comprehensive Outsourced Team Model, which includes an Outsourced Travel Manager plus so much more. Advitoâ€™s solution takes a holistic approach to managing your program versus simply filling a single seat. The comprehensive solution could include overall program strategy and business plan development air, hotel and car sourcing engagements, Dynamic Performance Management (DPM) and Traveler Engagement.'),
('a2Nw0000000bxAAEAY', 'Amy Bryan', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Performance Management', 'Advito - Policy Traveler Engagement', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Advito provides a re-designed and re-written global travel policy. This will be facilitated by aligning with company objectives, drafting and reviewing a new policy. Advito helps companies effectively communicate proper compliance, align with corporate culture, and ultimately drive better program performance.'),
('a2Nw0000000bxAFEAY', 'Inactive User', '005w0000003Dm0hAAC', 'Unknown', 'Advito - Collaboration Traveler Engagement', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Advito''s Total Collaboration Management is designed to help companies increase the ROI on their travel programs by incorporating virtual collaboration into their strategy.'),
('a2Nw0000000bxAKEAY', 'Erin Singleton', '0052X000007trrcQAA', 'Sourcing', 'Advito - Hotel', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Program Optimization', 'Corporate travel is changing, and old ways wonâ€™t open new doors. Advito''s experts produce useful, actionable spend management options with a holistic approach that combines advanced analytics, complete visibility, and expert insights. With Advito, you get the framework and resources you need to source the right suppliers, maximize corporate travel program performance, minimize spend and maintain the highest value agreements. We help travel managers align supply and demand across air, hotels, rail, car, and integrated meetings management categories.

Our unique Dynamic Performance Management (DPM) approach provides active, continuous program management and monitors spend in real time, matching long-term commitments with corporate objectives. DPM focuses on dynamically comparing performance to the market and quickly adapting to changes rather than waiting weeks or months before renegotiating contract.'),
('a2Nw0000000lfZrEAI', 'Michelle Ramirez', '005w00000060YA0AAM', 'Booking', 'TripSource Booking - Air', 'Active', 'Ticketing', 'OBT', 'Along with all the benefits of an itinerary management and traveler engagement platform, TripSource offers a proprietary booking solution providing a simplified digital experience for travelers. This is the perfect option for clients looking for a simple online booking solution thatâ€™s easy to implement and even easier to use. This record focuses on the air booking capabilities.'),
('a2Nw0000000lffGEAQ', 'Cherise George', '005w0000003DenvAAC', 'Centralized Operations', 'NORAM Elite 24', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Centralized Operations', 'Our Elite 24 team provides 24/7 care for a select subset of travelers in your program who are profiled out of the US or Canada. Enrollment should be focused on those travelers requiring that extra touch of knowing someone is looking out for their travel needs. 
Elite 24 consists of a designated team of US-based travel consultants** who have been highly trained to care specifically for our high-touch clients. The team monitors en route travel starting two hours before scheduled flight time. Should an Elite 24 member need to contact the Elite 24 team, they call a dedicated number available 24/7/365. The number of elite members an account may enroll in the program is determined by the accountâ€™s annual net transactions. Additionally, each member is welcome to designate one guest. Pricing for this fee-based service is determined by several factors, including membership type and account type (Cost Plus vs Fully Loaded).
**Select processes may be performed or supported offshore.'),
('a2Nw0000000lffLEAQ', 'Paul Dozmati', '005w0000003BofPAAS', 'Unknown', 'No Profile Tool', 'Inactive', 'Booking', 'OBT', 'No Profile Tool is available on GetThere and Concur.  No Profile Tool is a guest booking application that allows existing customers to allow non profiled travelers to book within GetThere or Concur using a customers site.'),
