('a2Nw0000000lgDkEAI', 'Katie Scotti', '005w0000005zrp5AAA', 'Expense', 'Cytric Expense', 'Inactive', 'Customer', 'DecisionSource Payment & Expense', 'Cytric Expense is an expense system directly integrated with Cytric Travel, creating and end-to-end travel and expense solution. Seamless end-to-end integration enables clients to take control of total travel spend and identify cost savings opportunities, as well as ensure expense are accounted for and reimbursed to travelers in a timely fashion.'),
('a2Nw0000000lgfNEAQ', 'Natalie Breedt', '00520000001lQkXAAU', 'Unknown', 'ClientBase', 'Active', 'Customer', 'Agent-Facing', 'Build and maintain strong, long-lasting relationships with ClientBase, Sabre''s Client Relationship Management (CRM) tool. Use it to manage complete profile, contact and trip management details.
This product is not dependent on Sabre Red Workspace.'),
('a2Nw0000000lgnREAQ', 'Gabi Gates', '005w0000005p7yfAAA', 'Expense', 'Concur Request - Direct', 'Active', 'Customer', 'OBT', 'BCD Travel has a referral agreement on Concur Request. If we can refer our client to Concur and the client signs-up for the Request product we get a commission. It works only if Concur didn''t have any relationship with the client before and if no other Concur Partner has referred our client before.'),
